<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>404 - Página no encontrada</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: #f3f4f6;
            color: #1f2937;
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        .tarjeta {
            background: #ffffff;
            max-width: 420px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .codigo {
            font-size: 5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1;
            color: #3b82f6;;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem;
        }

        p {
            color: #6b7280;
            margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .boton {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            background: #3b82f6;;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .boton:hover {
            background: #4338ca;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="tarjeta">
        <div class="codigo">404</div>
        <h1>Página no encontrada</h1>
        <p>La dirección que has escrito no existe o ha sido movida.</p>
        <a class="boton" href="/login">Volver al inicio</a>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
